  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower caregivers of children with cerebral palsy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our project targets particularly the caregivers of children with cerebral palsy in urban and rural environments to improve financial access.  Objective 1:  Mapp and select 300 caregivers of children with cerebral palsy  Train 300 caregivers in business skills and financial literacy Objective 2:  10 VSLA group formation.  Training of VSLA groups in VSLA principles and methodology  Objective 3:  Refer cases identified to health centers to support the linkage and reporting mechanisms</narrative>
  </description>
